# Build context for relay/Dockerfile is this `remote/` workspace root. The
# Dockerfile only COPYs the Cargo manifests and `*/src`, so `target/` (~1GB of
# local build artifacts) is dead weight in the context upload and must never
# leak into the image build. Keep this list conservative — exclude only what is
# never part of a build.
target/
**/target/
.git/
**/*.rs.bk
